  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "MarkdownField: a Markdown editor / viewer. The value is stored as Markdown text in the DB column and rendered to HTML when the field is read-only, so notes, specifications, procedures and AI-written text keep a searchable plain-text form. Editing offers a toolbar (heading, bold, italic, strikethrough, bulleted / numbered / task list, quote, link, inline code, code block, table) and a preview that is either a tab (Edit / Preview), side by side, or off (PreviewMode; read-only always shows the rendered preview). Properties: DbColumn, Placeholder, Rows, MaxLength, PreviewMode, ShowToolbar; validation for required and maximum length. Script API: Value, Html, PlainText, AppendLine(line). Rendering uses Markdig (BSD-2-Clause) with GitHub-style extensions, soft line breaks as line breaks and raw HTML disabled (untrusted text is rendered safely); links open in a new tab. Use RichTextField when the author does not know Markdown; use MarkdownField when the author is a Markdown user or an AI.",
